3. Main Components

Component

Purpose

Header

Displays project name

Task Title

Enters task name

Subject

Enters subject name

Due Date

Selects deadline

Add Task Button

Adds a new task

Task List

Displays saved tasks

Filter Buttons

Filters tasks

Edit Button

Updates a task

Complete Button

Marks task completed

Delete Button

Removes a task

